From: GloriousEggroll <gloriouseggroll@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] gamefixes: Kingdoms of Amalur: Re-Reckoning: install
 d3dcompiler_43 and d3dcompiler_47

Textures flicker between colors and parts of character models flicker in
and out of existence without the native shader compilers. Installing
d3dcompiler_43 and d3dcompiler_47 fixes it (GOG version via Heroic).
The umu ID covers the GOG, EGS and standalone entries in the database.

https://github.com/Open-Wine-Components/umu-database/issues/159
---
diff --git a/gamefixes-steam/1041720.py b/gamefixes-steam/1041720.py
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..9eefe68
--- /dev/null
+++ b/gamefixes-steam/1041720.py
@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
+"""Game fix for Kingdoms of Amalur: Re-Reckoning"""
+
+from protonfixes import util
+
+
+def main() -> None:
+    """Textures flicker and parts of character models flicker in and out without the native shader compilers"""
+    util.protontricks('d3dcompiler_43')
+    util.protontricks('d3dcompiler_47')
diff --git a/gamefixes-umu/umu-1041720.py b/gamefixes-umu/umu-1041720.py
new file mode 120000
index 0000000..0d5bfe5
--- /dev/null
+++ b/gamefixes-umu/umu-1041720.py
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+../gamefixes-steam/1041720.py
\ No newline at end of file
